# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Orialis CRM frontend - environment template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Copy to `.env` in this directory and fill in your own values:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHY NEITHER VARIABLE IS PREFIXED WITH VITE_
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Vite exposes a variable to client code ONLY when its name starts with
# `VITE_`. Such a variable is substituted into the JavaScript bundle at build
# time: `import.meta.env.VITE_X` literally becomes its value in a file served
# to every visitor. Anyone can read it with "View source".
#
# A secret can therefore never be a `VITE_` variable. Not because the .env is
# committed - it is not - but because the value ends up in the build output.
#
# Both variables below are intentionally UNPREFIXED. They are read by
# vite.config.js, which runs in Node on your machine, and are used by the dev
# server to reach the API. React never sees them, and Vite will refuse to
# expose them even by mistake.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRM_API_URL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Where the FastAPI CRM API is listening. The dev server proxies every
# browser request for `/api/...` to this address.
#
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000 when left unset.

CRM_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRM_API_KEY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The same key as `CRM_API_KEY` in the repository-root `.env` that the API
# itself reads. The dev server attaches it as the `X-API-Key` header on each
# proxied request.
#
# Without it the API answers 401 and the dashboard shows an error.

CRM_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What must NEVER appear in this file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# - DATABASE_URL, or any part of it. The frontend has no database access and
#   never will: every figure it displays comes from the CRM API.
# - Any Supabase host, project reference, password or service key.
